            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes, on a hard surface with clear airflow. Charging generates more heat than most discharging does, so avoid charging on carpet, in a cupboard or pressed against furniture, and use the manufacturer's own charger rather than a generic substitute.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
